      deterministic competitive ratio  ≥  2(k+1) - 1 = 2k + 1
      randomised competitive ratio     ≥  Ω( log k / log log k )

  ⚠ CAVEAT: this is a POINT OF REFERENCE for the general MTS.
            The restricted family of telemetry tasks may be
            much less adversarial; the bound is not inherited
            automatically. Prop. 6.2 is the PRIMARY lower bound.
